graph TD
    T["传输轴<br/>pending · answered · failed"]
    BZ["业务轴<br/>approve · steer · need_fix · reject"]
    EF["效果轴<br/>not-started · in-progress · applied<br/>blocked · failed · unknown"]

    T -->|"answered 不等于放行"| BZ
    BZ -->|"approve 后执行前锁内重核"| EF
